{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Movavi.MovaviVideoEditor","latestVersion":"27.3.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.6a57b1b8.png","priority":1,"sha256":"6a57b1b8517af8b3032c5570dfcd954199bbf6ea3198cb19bb10525ec1475f3b","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Movavi Software Limited","copyright":"Copyright © 2026 movavi.com","copyrightUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/eula.html","description":"Your simple video editor for creating wow videos","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/eula.html","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Movavi Software Limited","copyright":"Copyright © 2026 movavi.com","copyrightUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/eula.html","description":"Your simple video editor for creating wow videos","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/eula.html","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Your simple video editor for creating wow videos\n- Easily create clips for your socials, business, or family\n- Boost your videos with one-click auto subtitles and other AI tools\n- Choose from hundreds of titles, transitions, and music tracks","name":"Movavi Video Editor","packageUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/video-editor-plus/","privacyUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/privacy/","publisher":"Movavi","publisherSupportUrl":"https://help.movavi.com/","publisherUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/store.html","releaseNotes":"- Adjust Blocks’ length to fit your footage perfectly. Before, every Block had a set duration, so longer clips got cut short. Now you can drag its edges just like a regular clip and make it as long or short as you need – so your best moments stay in.\n- Enjoy a clearer, more convenient way to crop. The Crop tool now shows a before-and-after preview and an Applied status right after you hit the button, with a quick undo option nearby. Plus, cropped clips are now marked on the timeline for easier navigation.\n- Find the right element faster with smarter search. Type what you have in mind – like a color or a mood – and get relevant results, even when the exact word isn’t in the title. The perfect match is just a search away!","releaseNotesUrl":"https://content.movavi.com/configs/changelog/ve/win/x86_64/en_us/changelog.html","tags":["clip","creative","creativity","edit","editor","film","movie","video","video-editing","video-editor"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"用于制作精彩视频的简易视频编辑器","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"用于制作精彩视频的简易视频编辑器\n- 轻松为您的社交平台、商业或家庭制作视频短片\n- 使用一键自动生成字幕及其他 AI 工具提升视频效果\n- 从数百种标题、转场效果和音乐曲目中自由选择","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/cn/support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/cn/","tags":["创意","剪辑","影片","电影","视频","视频编辑","视频编辑器","编辑","编辑器"]}},"longDescription":"Your simple video editor for creating wow videos\n- Easily create clips for your socials, business, or family\n- Boost your videos with one-click auto subtitles and other AI tools\n- Choose from hundreds of titles, transitions, and music tracks","name":"Movavi Video Editor","packageUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/video-editor-plus/","privacyUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/privacy/","publisher":"Movavi","publisherSupportUrl":"https://help.movavi.com/","publisherUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://www.movavi.com/store.html","releaseNotes":"- Adjust Blocks’ length to fit your footage perfectly. Before, every Block had a set duration, so longer clips got cut short. Now you can drag its edges just like a regular clip and make it as long or short as you need – so your best moments stay in.\n- Enjoy a clearer, more convenient way to crop. The Crop tool now shows a before-and-after preview and an Applied status right after you hit the button, with a quick undo option nearby. Plus, cropped clips are now marked on the timeline for easier navigation.\n- Find the right element faster with smarter search. Type what you have in mind – like a color or a mood – and get relevant results, even when the